# drag-k-modes (M7): k's box (centre (383, 468) at 1440 x 900) dragged, its modifiers changing
# mid-drag: +50 px coarse holds 1.00; Shift pressed then starts a fine stretch from where the
# pointer is, so +50 px more adds 0.1 (1.100, its third decimal kept from then on: the badge
# "Fine ×0.1", the --accent stroke); Shift let go and Ctrl pressed snaps at once to the whole
# number (1.000, "Snap 1", the --warning stroke). The button stays down.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
move 383 468
wait 16
down
move 433 468 over 160
wait 16
shot coarse
hold Shift
move 483 468 over 160
wait 16
shot fine
release Shift
hold Control
wait 16
shot snap
release Control
wait 16
shot released-keys
